description	"Maw

A strong and formidable Dark Jedi whose anger & repulsorlift technology make him a musclebound levitating incarnation of rage.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee (Wookiee Style)
-- 25% slower RoF
- Lightsaber (Purple)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense/Deflect (1)
-- 25% less Purple damage
-- 10% longer
-- Cannot Roll/Slap
-- EX Saber Throw (1) ^3[CS1]
--- 43% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Grip (2) ^3[CS3]
- Dark Rage (3) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Fury (3)
-- Regen: 1/.20s
- Strength (2)
- Brawler Guard
- Climate Shielding (1)
- Blast Armor
- Force Block (1)
- Force Focus (2)
- Getup (2)
- BP-Free Jumps
- 20% more knockback taken

^3Abilities:
- Repulsorlift Flight (Jetpack)"